title: getattribute Operator (Examples)
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

<<.operator-example 1 "[[<<colour foreground>>]getattribute[$variable]]" "returns the name of the macro being invoked">>
<<.operator-example 2 "[[<<colour foreground>>]getattribute[name],[0]]" "returns the ''name'' parameter, falling back to the first positional parameter">>
<<.operator-example 3 "[[<$transclude $variable='colour' name='foreground'/>]getattribute[name],[0]]" "returns the ''name'' attribute of the widget invocation">>
<<.operator-example 4 "[[#ff0000]getattribute[name],[0]]" "returns nothing, because the input is not an invocation">>
